  "display_title": "I Love You (JO Min-Young)",
  "description": "Does love make you blind? Not just blind! A story about a workplace romance and a girl who's obviously in love! \n\nContrary to the saying, \"Love makes you beautiful,\" Sa-ae has a lot of tension to show to the other person. Kim Nam-joo, a childhood friend, gets confided in the agency after joining the company and gets treated for minor ailments. But Nam Joo doesn't like this agent who doesn't cherish each other... To make matters worse, Sa-ae finds out about her sloppy secret love affair from her boss, Shin. \n\n(Source: Kakaopage, translated & edited)",
